calc-energy --sim onec: energy.py reads sim's capacity/discharge... I passed --params too (it's optional; earlier rounds passed params - r1/r2 energy files exist with mass differences reflecting params, so --params bridges geometry for mass). Keep.

Note the aging SPMe: fine (r2 used spme too; sei 476-543 numbers came from those).

